# Cooked asset sidecars. Ember-Forge regenerates these in-place in the asset tree on every
# project export, and the runtime falls back to the source asset when one is missing.
# Not glTF buffers: those sit next to a .gltf as real source data. Our models are .glb
# (self-contained), so nothing here is source - but check before adding a .gltf + .bin pair.
*.bin

# Editor and runtime output
Logs/
Profiles/
